1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
BREAKING NEWS.
Two cats have escaped from the zoo!

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,800
Meet Ollie
and Hawk.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:15,800
Two adorable
Ragdoll cats.

4
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:22,800
They ran straight
into a local café…

5
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:26,400
And became
WAITERS!

6
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:33,400
The neighbourhood fell in love
with them.

7
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:40,000
They even started
their own group:

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
“Neighbourhood
Cat Watch.”

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:51,600
But the zookeepers
want them back!

10
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:58,600
Will Ollie and Hawk
return to the zoo?

11
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:04,400
Or stay with
their new family?

12
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:09,400
Watch tonight
to find out!
